      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>Last updated: July 4, 2026</p>
      <p>MITRA Interior &amp; Constructions ("we", "our", or "us") operates the MITRA website. This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data when you use our Service and the choices you have associated with that data.</p>
      
      <p>We use your data to contact you regarding free consultation site visits and detailed quotations. By requesting a consultation, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.</p>

      <h2>Information Collection And Use</h2>
      <p>While using our consultation booking forms, we may ask you to provide us with certain personally identifiable information that can be used to contact or identify you ("Personal Data"). Personally identifiable information may include, but is not limited to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>First name and last name</li>
        <li>Phone number</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Service requirements and estimated project budgets</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Terms of Service</h2>
      <p>Please read these Terms of Service ("Terms", "Terms of Service") carefully before using the MITRA website.</p>
      <p>Your access to and use of the Service is conditioned on your acceptance of and compliance with these Terms. These Terms apply to all visitors, users and others who access or use the Service.</p>

      <h2>Warranty Coverage &amp; Material Quotes</h2>
      <p>All structural construction projects executed by MITRA are covered by a 10-year structural warranty. Modular kitchens and wardrobes are covered by a 3-year or 7-year warranty on material carcasses and installation. Hardware warranties (such as soft-close slides and hinges) are backed directly by third-party manufacturers (e.g., Hettich, Hafele, Blum) as specified on itemised quotes.</p>
      <p>All locked, itemised quotations are valid for 30 days from the date of consultation site visit and sign-off.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our Terms of Service, please contact our administrative team at <a href="mailto:hello@mitrainteriors.in">hello@mitrainteriors.in</a> or visit our design studio at Shaikpet Main Road, Hyderabad, Telangana.</p>
